# Cursor models only

New semantic-integration inference uses `composer-2.5` via `cursor-agent --model composer-2.5`.

Do not launch GPT, Claude, Gemini, Sol, or `composer-2.5-fast` for new tests, constructor runs, or Task subagents.

Frozen BOM v3 (`gpt-5.6-sol-high`) stays frozen. Do not resume it. Do not use `ALLOW_EXPENSIVE_MODEL` except for that already-finished protocol.

After any `cursor-agent` run, check stream-json `system/init.model`. It must be `Composer 2.5`. Treat a GPT/Claude/Gemini report as a failed run.
